LOCATION:33 Cecil St
DESCRIPTION:More info: https://www.instagram.com/p/DXs5JftDjLa/\n\nHosted
  by Bayan Toronto (https://www.instagram.com/bayan_toronto/)\n\nAll are
  welcome to join this art build for screen printing and relief-printing
  rev-inspired art (bring your own clothes\, bags\, fabric\, paper to print
  on)! The group will also finish sewing a banner made of rice bags to
