SUMMARY:An Anarchist Queen and Her Radiant Protégé: Emma Goldman and
  Marie Tiboldo in Interwar Toronto - by Kensinton Market Historical
  Society
LOCATION:239 College St
DESCRIPTION:More info: https://www.instagram.com/p/DXkRSX9FX7K/\n\nHosted
  by Kensinton Market Historical Society (https://www.kmhs.ca/)\n\nEmma
  Goldman was an anarchist and anti-war activist who was instrumental in
  mentoring other activists during her time in Toronto. After Goldman’s
  death\, protégés like Marie Tiboldo continued her work. Join presenters
  Cynthia Wright and Franca Iacovetta to learn more about their impact on
  interwar Toronto.
END:VEVENT
